From: Remora <noreply@localhost>
Date: Sun, 2 Aug 2026 11:40:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] gbm_mesa: advertise HW_VIDEO_DECODER on linear RGB32 combos

Surface-bound c2-va sessions decode into RGBX so SurfaceFlinger never
GL-imports an NV12 dma-buf (fatal on Venus/NVIDIA: the host Vulkan
refuses the import and the ring dies, remora-e5x.21). Without the
decoder-usage combos on the 32bpp RGB formats, the RGBX output pool's
every fetch fails and playback stalls frameless.

---
diff --git a/gbm_mesa_driver/gbm_mesa_internals.cpp b/gbm_mesa_driver/gbm_mesa_internals.cpp
index aa8e8e1..9381d76 100644
--- a/gbm_mesa_driver/gbm_mesa_internals.cpp
+++ b/gbm_mesa_driver/gbm_mesa_internals.cpp
@@ -119,6 +119,19 @@ int gbm_mesa_driver_init(struct driver *drv)
 	drv_modify_combination(drv, DRM_FORMAT_ARGB8888, &linear_metadata, BO_USE_HW_VIDEO_ENCODER);
 	drv_modify_combination(drv, DRM_FORMAT_XRGB8888, &linear_metadata, BO_USE_HW_VIDEO_ENCODER);
 
+	/*
+	 * Linear 32bpp RGB as a DECODER destination as well: surface-bound
+	 * c2-va sessions decode into RGBX so SurfaceFlinger never has to
+	 * GL-import an NV12 dma-buf (fatal on the Venus/NVIDIA path — the
+	 * host Vulkan refuses the import and the ring dies, remora-e5x.21).
+	 * Without these combos the RGBX output pool's every fetch fails and
+	 * playback stalls frameless.
+	 */
+	drv_modify_combination(drv, DRM_FORMAT_ABGR8888, &linear_metadata, BO_USE_HW_VIDEO_DECODER);
+	drv_modify_combination(drv, DRM_FORMAT_XBGR8888, &linear_metadata, BO_USE_HW_VIDEO_DECODER);
+	drv_modify_combination(drv, DRM_FORMAT_ARGB8888, &linear_metadata, BO_USE_HW_VIDEO_DECODER);
+	drv_modify_combination(drv, DRM_FORMAT_XRGB8888, &linear_metadata, BO_USE_HW_VIDEO_DECODER);
+
 	/*
 	 * R8 format is used for Android's HAL_PIXEL_FORMAT_BLOB and is used for JPEG snapshots
 	 * from camera and input/output from hardware decoder/encoder.
